    <h3 itemprop="headline">Former college soccer player found dead off San Diego beach in one of nation's wealthiest beach communities</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Bryn Waite, a former Central Washington University soccer player from Anchorage, was found dead in waters off La Jolla Shores Beach in San Diego.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/us/2026/07/27/former-college-soccer-player-found-dead-off-san-diego-beach-one-nations-wealthiest-beach-communities/"  >(Fox News)</a>
