    <div class="image" role="presentation">
      <img src="/static15/politics/2026/07/27/debt-ridden-democrats-tap-surprising-asset-collateral-15m-loan.webp" alt="Debt-ridden Democrats tap a surprising asset as collateral for $15M loan" itemprop="image" width="400" height="225"
        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Debt-ridden Democrats tap a surprising asset as collateral for $15M loan</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      The Democratic National Committee used its headquarters as collateral for a record $15 million off-year loan as it carries $18.5 million in debt against the RNC&apos;s huge war chest.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/07/27/debt-ridden-democrats-tap-surprising-asset-collateral-15m-loan/"  >(Fox News)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</div><div class="column vcwi"><div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/NewsArticle" class="card">
  <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="Wed, 22 Jul 2026 11:47:33 GMT">
  <meta itemprop="dateModified" content="Wed, 22 Jul 2026 11:47:33 GMT">
  <span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <meta itemprop="name" content="The Associated Press, MPR News">
  </span>
  <div class="card-content">
    <div class="image" role="presentation">
      <img src="/static15/politics/2026/07/22/hegseth-estimates-iran-war-has-cost-375-billion-defends-funding-request-fiery-hearing.webp" alt="Hegseth estimates Iran war has cost $37.5 billion as he defends funding request at fiery hearing" itemprop="image" width="400" height="225"
        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Hegseth estimates Iran war has cost $37.5 billion as he defends funding request at fiery hearing</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth said the U.S. war against Iran has cost $37.5 billion so far. Hegseth faced fiery questions and protests over the U.S. war against Iran at a Senate hearing Tuesday.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/07/22/hegseth-estimates-iran-war-has-cost-375-billion-defends-funding-request-fiery-hearing/"  >(The Associated Press, MPR News)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</div></div></fieldset></main>
